    "Each check only means anything once the one above it has passed, so a run stops at the first failure." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada comprobación solo significa algo cuando ha pasado la de arriba, así que la serie se detiene en el primer fallo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each section is one model call. It keeps going if you leave this screen, and you can stop it at any point and keep what was written." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada sección es una llamada al modelo. Sigue en marcha aunque salgas de esta pantalla, y puedes detenerlo en cualquier momento conservando lo ya escrito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each section is one model call. You can cancel at any point and keep what was written up to then." : {
