          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Versiones de texto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That address is not available in the isolated browser." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esa dirección no está disponible en el navegador aislado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That address is served by “%@”, not by a Nodus Server." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esa dirección la sirve «%@», no un Nodus Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That address will not work" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esa dirección no vale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That address will not work. Enter just the domain, with no path." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esa dirección no sirve. Escribe solo el dominio, sin rutas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That email or password is not right." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ese correo o esa contraseña no son correctos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That table does not accept changes from a client." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esa tabla no admite cambios desde un cliente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That usually means the computer Nodus lives on is off, asleep, or has the application closed." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suele significar que el ordenador donde vive Nodus está apagado, dormido o con la aplicación cerrada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The \\(provider.label) key is missing, and that is the provider this vault was indexed with." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Falta la clave de \\(provider.label), que es el proveedor con el que se indexó este vault."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ key is missing, and that is the provider this vault was indexed with." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Falta la clave de %@, y ese es el proveedor con el que se indexó este vault."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI trace is already queued." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta traza de IA ya está en cola."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The annotation is waiting on this device" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La anotación espera en este dispositivo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app and the server are on different releases. Anything that behaves oddly should be suspected here first." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La app y el servidor están en versiones distintas. Si algo se comporta de forma rara, sospecha primero de aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The browser supports up to 24 open tabs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El navegador admite hasta 24 pestañas abiertas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The certificate" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El certificado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The certificate is pinned before the first request. Pairing never creates a cloud relay and grants only the vaults and private domains shown on the Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se pincha el certificado antes de la primera solicitud. La puesta en paralelo nunca crea un relé en la nube y otorga solo los baúles y dominios privados mostrados en el Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The certificate was refused. A Nodus Server needs one this device already trusts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se rechazó el certificado. Un Nodus Server necesita uno en el que este dispositivo ya confíe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The change exceeds the maximum row size." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El cambio supera el tamaño máximo por fila."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The change was malformed." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El cambio venía mal formado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The contradiction could not be loaded from this space." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo cargar la contradicción desde este espacio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The contradiction is that “%@” is in tension with “%@”." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La contradicción está en que «%@» entra en tensión con «%@»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation lasts as long as this report is open. Nothing is saved." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La conversación dura lo que dure este informe abierto. No se guarda nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy in iCloud was removed from another device." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La copia en iCloud se eliminó desde otro dispositivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy is out of date" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La copia está desfasada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The credential is deleted from this device. Nothing changes on the server." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se borra la credencial de este dispositivo. Nada cambia en el servidor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The deletion is queued and applied by the owner Desktop without duplicating retries." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La eliminación está programada y se aplica por el escritorio propietario sin duplicar intentos de reenvío."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The document package contains an unsafe path." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El paquete del documento contiene una ruta no segura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The document package does not contain Clean Markdown." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El paquete del documento no contiene Markdown limpio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded document did not match its published fingerprint." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El documento descargado no coincide con su huella publicada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The embedding provider answered \\(status)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El proveedor de embeddings respondió \\(status)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The example vault is on this device, so there is no server to answer this." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El vault de ejemplo está en este dispositivo, así que no hay servidor que pueda responder a esto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The focus narrows retrieval; every claim still requires a corpus citation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El foco reduce la recuperación; cada afirmación aún requiere una cita del corpus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The full report is unavailable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El informe completo no está disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The highlight is waiting on this device" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El subrayado está pendiente en este dispositivo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keychain failed: \\(message) (\\(status))." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El llavero falló: \\(message) (\\(status))."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keychain is unavailable while the device is locked." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El llavero no está disponible mientras el dispositivo está bloqueado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keychain refused because this build is not signed (−34018)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El llavero rechazó la operación porque esta compilación no está firmada (−34018)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The link between themes and ideas travels in the publication but the API does not expose it. Download it and this list works instantly." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El vínculo entre temas e ideas viaja en la publicación, pero la API no lo expone. Descárgala y esta lista funcionará al instante."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac is unavailable. This read-only copy is AES-GCM encrypted, protected while the device is locked and removed when the pairing is revoked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El Mac está indisponible. Esta copia de solo lectura está cifrada con AES-GCM, protegida mientras el dispositivo esté bloqueado y eliminada cuando se revoca la puesta en paralelo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The map grows from one idea, following the relations the analysis found: what supports it, what refines it, and what argues against it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El mapa crece desde una idea siguiendo las relaciones que encontró el análisis: qué la apoya, qué la refina y qué la contradice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model did not return a usable replacement." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El modelo no devolvió un reemplazo válido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model returned \\(received) dimensions and this vault needs \\(expected)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El modelo devolvió \\(received) dimensiones y este vault necesita \\(expected)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name resolves, but nothing answered. The server may be stopped, or reachable only from the machine it runs on." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El nombre resuelve, pero no contestó nadie. Puede que el servidor esté parado o que solo se le llegue desde la máquina en la que corre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The offline copy is needed" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hace falta la copia sin conexión"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original file will be available in a future version." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El archivo original estará disponible en una versión futura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The owner desktop creates the vault note through a typed action." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El escritorio propietario crea la nota del baúl a través de una acción tipada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the plan came back empty" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "el plan vino vacío"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The portable checks found no unresolved chronology, thread, rule or blocking-question issues." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los dispositivos portátiles no encontraron ningún problema de cronología, hilos, reglas o preguntas bloqueantes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The property is written through the same typed mutation ledger as Desktop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La propiedad se escribe mediante la misma mutación tipificada que en el escritorio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider returned an empty vector." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El proveedor devolvió un vector vacío."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The published corpus no longer contains this contradiction." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El corpus publicado ya no contiene esta contradicción."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The query failed" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La consulta falló"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The question failed" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La pregunta falló"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reading bookmark" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El marcador de lectura"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The refutation is that “%@” refuses “%@”." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La refutación está en que «%@» rechaza «%@»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report could not be laid out for printing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo maquetar el informe para imprimirlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report could not be queued on this device." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se ha podido poner el informe en la cola de este dispositivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report failed" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El informe falló"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report goes to the clipboard and nowhere else. It carries no credential and no provider key." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El informe va al portapapeles y a ningún otro sitio. No lleva ninguna credencial ni ninguna clave de proveedor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report has no illustration" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El informe se queda sin imagen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report is incomplete" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El informe quedó incompleto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The row page keeps blocks, comments, backlinks and ACLs under stable ID %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La página de filas mantiene bloques, comentarios, enlaces inversos y ACLs bajo un ID estable %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secret could not be encoded." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo codificar el secreto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sections already written are kept, and you can carry on from there later. Nothing more will be spent." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las secciones ya escritas se conservan y podrás continuar desde ahí más adelante. No se gastará nada más."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server hands over the material and the budget; you choose the model. Your key is kept in this device's keychain and never passes through the Nodus Server." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El servidor entrega el material y el presupuesto; el modelo lo eliges tú. Tu clave se guarda en el llavero de este dispositivo y nunca pasa por el Nodus Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server keeps your changes in a ledger. They join the vault when its owner opens Nodus desktop and republishes. Until then nobody sees them, you included." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
